---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import GuideArticle from '../../components/v2/templates/GuideArticle.astro';
import FAQ from '../../components/FAQ.astro';
import { siteImages } from '../../data/images';
import { getPageSEO } from '../../utils/seo';

const faqItems = [
  { question: 'How do players access Choopy?', answer: 'A dated gameplay record shows Choopy opened from the Phone interface. Check the current Phone menu because its labels and availability may change.' },
  { question: 'Where does a Choopy delivery appear?', answer: 'In the dated gameplay record reviewed for this guide, the delivered box appeared outside the restaurant entrance. This location should be treated as version-specific.' },
  { question: 'How is a received item placed?', answer: 'The same dated record shows an item being placed through a table Customize control. Follow the controls shown in the current game.' },
];
---

<BaseLayout pageId="guides-choopy-mystery-box" breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Guides', href: '/guides/' }, { label: getPageSEO('guides-choopy-mystery-box').h1 }]}>
<GuideArticle
  title={getPageSEO('guides-choopy-mystery-box').h1}
  kicker="Decorations guide"
  intro="A dated gameplay record shows Choopy as a Phone-based delivery interaction connected with restaurant customization."
  tableOfContents
  heroImage={siteImages.decorationsHero}
  relatedLinks={[
    { label: 'Decorations', href: '/decorations/', description: 'Browse customization categories and connected pages.' },
    { label: 'Tiles', href: '/decorations/tiles/', description: 'Review the Tiles customization directory.' },
    { label: 'Counter Guide', href: '/guides/counter-upgrades/', description: 'Plan Counter changes around the restaurant layout.' },
    { label: 'Decorations Part 1', href: '/updates/decorations-part-1/', description: 'Read the dated update record connected with this period.' },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="what-choopy-is">What Choopy Is</h2>
  <p>Choopy appears in dated community gameplay as a way to receive an item for restaurant customization. “Mystery Box” is a common community description, but this guide does not assume that wording, a fixed item pool, or the same interface will remain permanent.</p>

  <h2 id="access">How Players Access Choopy</h2>
  <p>A gameplay record dated September 2, 2026 shows the player opening Choopy through the Phone interface. Open the current Phone menu and use only the option and confirmation details visible in your server.</p>

  <h2 id="delivery">How Delivery Works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Phone and select the Choopy option shown by the current interface.</li>
    <li>Read the live confirmation before making a selection.</li>
    <li>After the interface reports a delivery, check the area outside the restaurant entrance.</li>
    <li>Interact with the delivered box using the prompt shown in the game.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="placement">How to Place a Received Item</h2>
  <p>The dated record shows the player approaching a table, opening <strong>Customize</strong>, selecting an available position, and placing the received item. If the current controls differ, follow the labels in your server rather than the older sequence.</p>

  <h2 id="unconfirmed">What Is Still Unconfirmed</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A permanent box price or delivery timer.</li>
    <li>The complete item pool, probabilities, or guaranteed outcomes.</li>
    <li>Whether “Mystery Box” is the permanent official feature name.</li>
    <li>Whether Choopy was formally introduced by the exact Decorations Part 1 patch.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="troubleshooting">Troubleshooting</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If the option is missing, check the current Phone interface and an updated server.</li>
    <li>If delivery is reported but no box is visible, check outside the restaurant entrance before repeating an action.</li>
    <li>If placement is unavailable, approach a table and review its current Customize controls.</li>
  </ul>

  <FAQ slot="faq" items={faqItems} />
</GuideArticle>
</BaseLayout>
